A class key-value splits into class tokens

```
{class="a b" .a}
para
.
<p class="a b">para</p>
```

```
[x]{class="a b" .b}
.
<p><span class="a b">x</span></p>
```

```
[x]{class="a  b a"}
.
<p><span class="a b">x</span></p>
```

```
{.b}
{class="a b"}
para
.
<p class="b a">para</p>
```

```
{class=""}
para
.
<p class="">para</p>
```

```
{class="javascript:x y"}
para
.
<p class="y">para</p>
```
